@xiciyang/inference-quantization README · inference-quantization：**Quantize a model and prove it — or get an explicit failure.** Give it a checkpoint, an accuracy
tolerance and a performance target; it runs PTQ (default AWQ + INT4 via llmcompressor) inside a
container, then applies two independent gates:

@xiciyang/inference-quantization README · inference-quantization：A downloaded-but-truncated model once quantized for 436 s and got signed off as "zero accuracy loss"
because its output was uniform and both perplexities were bit-identical. That is the incident these
two gates exist for. Source-model structure preflight (`E_SOURCE_MODEL_INVALID`) is the other half.

@xiciyang/inference-quantization README · 为什么"测量成立性"必须单独判：> 目录哈希（"内容有没有被改动"）与结构预检（"是不是完整模型"）是**两个不同的问题**。
> 只做前者，就会在一份**从未损坏过**的坏输入上一路绿灯。

